{"ref":"BDB, חַי²","hw":"חַי²","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חַי</span></big>  <strong>adj.</strong> alive, living;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:6\" href=\"/Genesis.25.6\">Gn 25:6</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:20\" href=\"/Genesis.3.20\">Gn 3:20</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:14\" href=\"/Amos.8.14\">Am 8:14</a> + 15 times (Ew<sup>§ 329</sup> explains as cstr., but Ges<sup>§ 93, R 7 n.</sup> al. as contracted abs.); f. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:20\" href=\"/Genesis.1.20\">Gn 1:20</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 116:9\" href=\"/Psalms.116.9\">ψ 116:9</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>of God</em>, as the <em>living one</em>, the fountain of life <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל חַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:10\" href=\"/Joshua.3.10\">Jos 3:10</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:1\" href=\"/Hosea.2.1\">Ho 2:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:3\" href=\"/Psalms.42.3\">ψ 42:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 84:3\" href=\"/Psalms.84.3\">84:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אלהים חי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.4\">2 K 19:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.16\">16</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.4\">Is 37:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.17\">17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אלהים חיים</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.20\">Dt 5:23</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.26\">1 S 17:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.36\">36</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.10\">Je 10:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:36\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.36\">23:36</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חי יהוה</span> <em>Yahweh is living</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:47\" href=\"/Psalms.18.47\">ψ 18:47</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:47\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.47\">2 S 22:47</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גאלי חי</sp